 shrooms inside Grocery Store at the Yonge and Lawrence corner\n\nDetails o
 f Event Below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent
  Details:\n\n**WALK\, TALK and ICE CREAM! (Nature\, Neighbourhoods and Pub
  after)**\n**(Yonge and Lawrence)**\n\n\\*We can get to know everyone\, ta
 ke some lovely scenic photos and share some laughs\n\\*Perhaps play a coup
 le ice breaker games as well to help build some bonds\n\\*Great way to nat
 urally make connections and release all the stress from the day\n\\*Stick 
 around after if you like as we will grab some ice cream\, food and beverag
 es close to where our starting point is\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n5 dollars (c
