 il.com\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \n\n**Location and Time: Where and When to meet us?**\n\n\\*We will meet o
 utside Tim Hortons **(3080 Yonge Street)**\n(Very Close to the Subway line
 \, and plenty of Free Street Parking along Lawrence)\n\n\\*Arrive early if
  you like (however we will meet out front at\n7:00 p.m. (we will wait for 
